Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔有时会很烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale could... could get under your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他反正把我气的够呛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure got under mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他敢于直言自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he wasn't afraid to say exactly what he thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种诚实很珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of honesty is rare,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:47.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每当我做决定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever I'd make a decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是会看着戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd look at Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也会用他的那种表情看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be looking back at me with that look he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都多少见过他那种表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all seen it one time or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时看不透他  但他却能完全看透我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't always read him, but he could read us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能看透一个人的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw people for who they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他了解我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew things about us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的真相...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的真实自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who we really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后  他还在谈论着丧失人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, he was talking about losing our humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说这个队伍散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said this group was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,致敬他的最好方式就是重新团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best way to honor him is to unbreak it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求同存异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set aside our differences and pull together,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再怨天尤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop feeling sorry for ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要掌握我们自己的命运...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take control of our lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有散\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要证明他是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna prove him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始...\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要按他的信念行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna do it his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们致敬戴尔的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is how we honor Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会很拥挤的  14个人在一间屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be tight, 14 people in one house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.63,0:03:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沼泽会冻住  小溪会干涸...\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the swamp hardening, the creek drying up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上农场的50头牲畜\N{\fnArial\fs30}With 50 head of cattle on the property,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:36.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就像行尸的大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might as well be ringing a damn dinner bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们早该让你们住进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've moved you in a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们把车移到每道门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's move the vehicles near each of the doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-面超着大路  -放那里就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- facing out toward the road.  - Just leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在风车房和谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll build a lookout in the windmill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设立哨岗  这样视线就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}another in the barn loft. That should give us sightlines
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覆盖农场的两边\N{\fnArial\fs30}both sides of the property.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,T仔  你在房子周围巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-Dog, you take the perimeter around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意每个进出的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep track of everyone coming and going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那站岗怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about standing guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你和达里尔身兼两份职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you and Daryl on double duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会在地下室囤积食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stock the basement with food and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况糟糕  也足够我们生存几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough that we can all survive there a few days if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外围巡逻怎么办  我们先封锁这个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about patrols?Let's get this area locked down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后肖恩分配轮班\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, Shane'll assign shifts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和达里尔会把兰德尔带走放生\N{\fnArial\fs30}while me and Daryl take Randall offsite and cut him loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又要放他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back to that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本就应该这么做  只怪当时执行不力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the right plan first time around.Poor execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是轻描淡写\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a slight understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你不同意  也要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't agree, but this what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我忍着  然后继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swallow it. Move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白戴尔的死和囚犯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that Dale's death and the prisoner...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是两回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's two separate things, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想带达里尔去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take Daryl as your wingman,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你的便\N{\fnArial\fs30}be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you.  - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你为什么不带肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see why you're not taking Shane with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要明白只要他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just know I've got no more patience
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会有多少耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he's concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会改头换面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's turning over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和达里尔出去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm out with Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮着赫谢尔照看一下这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}help Hershel keep an eye on things around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我吗  -肖恩总喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me?  - Shane's got a way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让事情变得失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}of letting things get out of hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其在他情绪不稳定的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially when he's all torqued up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们现在情绪都不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're all a bit torqued up at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他要在这里长住  都就必须明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're staying here permanently, he's got to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在由我和瑞克做主  而不是他为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's what Rick and I say, not whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们关系不错  -我们常聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've become close.  - We talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就知道他不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know he's not a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是自控能力不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just his own worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我当肖恩的保姆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to babysit Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要确定每次我离开农场时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to make sure every time I leave the farm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不会变的一发不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}all hell doesn't break loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么也许你就不应该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe you should stop leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能帮我看着这里吗  -当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you keep an eye on things?  - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  肖恩  -怎么了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Shane? - What's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛呢  一个人在这里乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing, wandering around by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我告诉你一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, um... If I tell you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能保证不告诉我父母吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you promise not to tell my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这不是个好主意  小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's probably a bad idea for both of us, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从达里尔的摩托上拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it from Daryl's motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.47,0:07:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他发现是我拿的  他会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he found out I took it, he'd kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:08.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿枪干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔  他的死是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale. It's my fault that he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  你怎么能这样说  他是被行尸杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, why would you say that, man? He got bit by a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么...  -我见过那只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you say...  - I saw that walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来准备打死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna shoot it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时他被困在泥里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he was stuck in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朝他身上丢石块\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was... I was throwing rocks at him and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我准备做的  我准备把它爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was gonna do it... shoot it right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是它挣脱了泥潭  开始追我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it... it got free, came after me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我杀了它  戴尔就不会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had killed it, Dale would still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  你不准再这么说  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, I want you to stop that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你必须留着这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need to hold onto this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  只要我在你身边  你就不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm around you,nothing's gonna happen to you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没法每时每刻都罩着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't keep my eyes on you 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得自己照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  拿着  我再也不碰枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, take it.I'm never touching another gun again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  这由不得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't no option, Carl, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它还给达里尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it back to Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人们都在里屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把你的东西放我房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put your stuff upstairs in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你爸也在家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your dad in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是把东西放这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just... I'm just gonna put my stuff over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心  别累坏自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Don't... don't... Don't strain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  瑞克  卡尔就住客厅角落吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and Carl and I are taking the corner of the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西放我房里去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can put that in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡那儿舒服些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be more comfortable there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎能让孕妇和孩子睡地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pregnant woman and child sleeping on the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.39,0:09:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己却睡床上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I've got a bed to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟房子是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is still your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是大家的了  我在楼下睡沙发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our home. I'll take the couch downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前  我晚上回家时经常浑身酒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}On nights when I came home reeking of bourbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆就把我锁在卧室外\N{\fnArial\fs30}my wife would lock the bedroom door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我和沙发是老朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sad to say that couch and I become old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们俩没法决定  可以给我嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you two can't decide, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙发是我的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couch is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡这屋里肯定舒服多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get real cozy real fast in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不喊别人来帮忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't that be easier if you waited for some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己动手  丰衣足食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no use waiting for something that ain't gonna come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己来就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it all myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你总这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you always do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如那次你大显身手  修好了我家水槽  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like that time you showed.up Rick fixing our sink.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说句  你家地下室透水是另有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, that's not the reason your basement flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这你该怪瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank Rick for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁让他铁管里装橡胶圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using rubber washers with a metal pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能下来一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚的事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.57,0:11:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们能重新振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought "We'll figure this out."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们心中的创伤能痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'll heal somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是戴尔之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须面对现实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一再逃避了\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep it at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覆水难收\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一波未平一波又起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it just keeps coming, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把事情搞得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mess of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你和瑞克兄弟反目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put you and Rick at odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不知道这孩子是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know whose baby this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想象这对你有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine how hard that is on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不顾自己  带领我们逃离亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led us out of Atlanta with no thought for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得那天晚上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城市的熊熊大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flames, the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坐在你车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sitting in our car
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着"我们会平安的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking "We're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他会保护我们  我们能逃出去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna make it all right. We'll get out of here."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我却从没说声"谢谢"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never thanked you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:51.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我俩的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though things got...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变得尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}confused between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也一直保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不离不弃  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there for me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to thank me for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我当然要  当然要  -不用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course I do. Of course I do.  - No, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论我们之间发生过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论我们以为拥有什么感情...\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever the hell we thought it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只你这么以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请相信我  我真心抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe me. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到锡诺亚村  来回差不多两小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out to Senoia... hour there, hour back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候天可能会黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}give or take. We may lose the light,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也差不多该到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll be halfway home by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这屁事真是烦死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little pain in the ass will be a distant memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔给他备了些干粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol's putting together some provisions for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够他吃几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough to last a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚你做的事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing you did last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能每次都让你做难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no reason you should do all the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对放他走没什么意见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you good with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:27.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不同意也不反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see you and I trading haymakers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那场辩论没人赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the side of the road. Nobody'd win that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你最近和卡尔谈过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you seen Carl lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他妈妈在屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's inside with his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:47.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我原本不该告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I wasn't supposed to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天去了沼泽地\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was out in the swamps yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现一只行尸陷在沼泽里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he came across a walker stuck in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他害怕  就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got scared, ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是杀死戴尔的那只行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same walker that killed Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那只\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让洛莉跟他谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have Lori talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  哥们  我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他是想跟他爹谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants to talk to his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先把兰德尔的事解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I need this Randall thing done already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  那事可以先缓缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that needs to wait, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不我和达里尔去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I ride out with Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他多相处一下  对大家都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for us to spend a little time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  我要你留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我办不好这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think I'll handle it right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我可没这么说  -那你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't say that.  - What you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, your son...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把它还给达里尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get that back to Daryl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,释放那犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeing that prisoner...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说居然比卡尔更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}more important to you than Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:16:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚  你有踩油门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea. Hey, did you try pumping the gas pedal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是因为太久没开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's been parked too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得先轻踩三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tap it three times...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再点火  我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give her a twist. I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔教过我 像这种老爷车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Dale told me that in these old vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有些锈蚀\N{\fnArial\fs30}the points get corroded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要螺丝起子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwdriver?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要一字起子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把锉刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you hand me a file?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让他失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然在那一刻不是  但总的来说是骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not in that moment, but overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得倒轻巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时支持他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有自己后悔的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my share of regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得他心里知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think that he knew
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有多关心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much we cared for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车应该能开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜肯定好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈说你会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom said you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她我来放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her I would stand lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我厌倦在屋子那边帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got tired of helping around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔身上发生的事情跟你没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Dale had nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他  他死了  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He... he died, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近很多人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like there's a lot of that going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:42.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再把你当小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more kid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能拥有像我一样的童年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you could have the childhood I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:52.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会死  妈妈也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die. Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远无法心情平静的面对死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way you can ever be ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试着那样去做  但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to be, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在能做的就是尽量不去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best we can do now is avoid it as long as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活在当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep one step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能说些更好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had something better to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些  一些深刻的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}something... something more profound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was good like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我累了  儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm tired, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能弄到这么些箭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only got so many arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是戴尔的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Dale's gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:49.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想知道我的枪在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I knew where the hell mine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-准备好了  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去拿背包  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get the package.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  兰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管事的说了  可以把你放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor called. You're off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.54,0:23:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.23,0:23:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘  往那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.85,0:23:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别吭声  别吭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh-shh-shh-shh. Hey-hey, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  我也许是你最不想见到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I'm the last face you probably want to see, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:50.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我会把你从这带走  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm gonna take you up out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这个摘下来让你呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get this off of you so you can breathe,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:23:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你必须保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want you to keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你听懂了吗  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You listen good. Do you hear me? Okay.  - Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.15,0:23:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do nothing stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey-hey, keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.43,0:24:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那群人  你知道他们现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your group... you know where they're at?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不知道  真的  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. I really... oh!  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.45,0:24:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我起来  现在我是让你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your little ass up here. Now I'm the only shot
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开这片树林的唯一机会  你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of you getting out of these woods alive. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.30,0:24:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你说  他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you start talking, boy. Where are they at?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在高速旁建了个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a camp set up off the highway...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好  -离这里大概5公里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay.  - About five miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道他们还在不在那啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows if they're still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.45,0:24:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.35,0:24:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会带我去找他们是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30} So you gonna take me to 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.47,0:24:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.55,0:24:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  伙计  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, man, I... I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.49,0:24:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够这帮人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with this group, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.81,0:24:37.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们迟早完蛋  但是我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They doomed and I want no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就是这样  -你不准备杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all.  - So you're not gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.53,0:24:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我想杀你  你现在已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. If I was, you'd be dead. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用这么粗暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you ain't gotta be so rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.34,0:24:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在在同一战线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the same side now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢跟我们在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna like it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets a little crazy sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.13,0:24:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是是很顽强的一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's a tough bunch of guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:24:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会很合群的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll fit in good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少说话  多走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less talking, more walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我紧张的时候就会说个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I run my mouth when I get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.61,0:25:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我控制不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.22,0:25:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我心里事儿很多  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot going on, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事不只跟你有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没说跟我有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I ain't saying it's about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生什么了  -兰德尔不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong?  - Randall's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了  怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing? How.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.93,0:26:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见多长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's he been gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.21,0:26:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生什么了  -很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's goin' on?  - It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.14,0:26:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手铐还钩在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cuffs are still hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他一定是滑脱的  -那可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He must' slipped 'em.  - Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你命悬一线就有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is if you've got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.95,0:26:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门是有密码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was secured from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:47.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生什么了  -他有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened?  - He's armed!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他拿了我的枪  -你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got my gun!  - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.13,0:26:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  那个混蛋偷袭我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Little bastard just snuck up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.51,0:26:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他揍我脸一拳  -赫谢尔  T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He clocked me in the face.  - All right, Hershel, T-Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.33,0:26:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带所有人回屋子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}get everybody back in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  达里尔跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Daryl, come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-T仔  我要那把枪  -让他走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- T, I'm gonna need that gun.  - Just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.02,0:27:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是打算让他走  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the plan, wasn't it, to just let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.73,0:27:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划是把他带到远离这儿  再给他松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan was to cut him loose far away from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.45,0:27:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是带着枪  离我们这么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}not on our front step with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.06,0:27:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别去那儿  你们知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go out there. Ya'll know what can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.35,0:27:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带所有人进屋里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everybody back in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把所有门锁上  待着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock all the doors and stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:18.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走  到屋里去  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, back in the house.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我晕倒前看到 他沿那条路往树林里跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him head up through the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.09,0:27:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他沿那条路往树林里跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that way before I blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定走了多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会走太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他腿瘸了  精疲力尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hobbled, exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.07,0:27:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-而且拿着枪  -我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And armed. - So are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能找到他的踪迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you track him?  nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.00,0:27:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不能  我什么也没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30} - No, I don't see nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  没必要追踪他  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, there ain't no use in tracking him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.83,0:27:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他朝那个方向去了  我们需要俩俩组队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went that way. We need to pair up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分头找  追上他  就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spread out, we just chase him down. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.57,0:27:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子手无缚鸡之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid weighs a buck-25 soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.06,0:27:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说是他扑倒了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to tell us he got the jump on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.75,0:27:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一块石头足够撂倒任何人  你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say a rock pretty much evens those odds, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.71,0:27:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  都别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.05,0:27:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和格伦去搜右侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Glenn start heading up the right flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:51.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和肖恩搜左侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Shane'll take the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面可不只兰德尔一个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Randall's not the only threat out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.53,0:27:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相照应点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.99,0:28:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来伤的不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's busted pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.62,0:28:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.26,0:28:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.40,0:29:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样找没用  你有灯么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is pointless. You got a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又回到起点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna do a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不妨把它做对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might as well do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.51,0:30:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有两道踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two sets of tracks right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.12,0:30:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩肯定比他说的跟的远的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane must've followed him a lot longer than he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树上有新鲜血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's fresh blood on this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.66,0:30:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还有更多踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来像是两人前后走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're walking in tandem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:30:59.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.47,0:31:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面这儿有点土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there was a little dust up right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.56,0:31:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么意思  -有东西摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean?  - I mean something went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是越来越诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.07,0:31:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到过小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a little trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.97,0:32:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this way feel right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.35,0:32:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}As right as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.93,0:32:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-抢了你的枪是吧  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snatched your gun, huh?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.16,0:32:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是我最喜爱的一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my favorite piece too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.87,0:32:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会希望...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna wish he'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.97,0:33:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到他时  他会希望当初杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}wish he'd killed me when I find his sorry ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.92,0:33:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  脖子都断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got his neck broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.39,0:33:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他身上没有咬痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got no bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.31,0:33:32.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, none you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  告诉你死因是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm telling you he died from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.74,0:34:10.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说他用拿石头砸了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say he got you with a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.43,0:34:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在棚屋里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为T仔说他过去的时候门是锁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that door was shut when T-Dog rolled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.05,0:34:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.81,0:34:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是爬上屋顶的椽木溜出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've slipped through the rafters in the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.56,0:35:04.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这就是你打算动手的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where you planned to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.36,0:35:10.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good place as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.11,0:35:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少有胆量叫这什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least have the balls to call this what it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.11,0:35:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得如果你一个人回农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe if you walk back onto that farm alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.37,0:35:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我和兰德尔都不见了  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No me, no Randall...  - I want you to hush up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.35,0:35:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得他们会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe they're gonna buy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.27,0:35:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你编出来的那些狗屁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever bullshit story you cook up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.20,0:35:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是事实  不是编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just it. It ain't no story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.18,0:35:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到那囚犯枪杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that prisoner shoot you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.55,0:35:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.48,0:35:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后扭断了他的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snapped his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't gonna be easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.57,0:35:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但洛莉和卡尔  他们会放下你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Lori and Carl... They'll get over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.85,0:35:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们放下过一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.59,0:35:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:35:58.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.31,0:36:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我们都解决这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we worked this all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.81,0:36:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那会想要杀死对方啊  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to kill each other, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎样  当这事没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you think? We just gonna forget about it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.32,0:36:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起在夕阳下开车兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna ride off into the sunset together?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.46,0:36:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后冷血地杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill me in cold blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟蹋我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.66,0:36:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的孩子们  我的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have my children... my children...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喊你爸爸  就是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}call you daddy? Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.14,0:36:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的生活一毛不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}That life won't be worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.97,0:36:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.23,0:36:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法这样活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be able to live with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于我能承受多少你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you know about what I can live with?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.55,0:36:39.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我能承受什么  承受了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no idea what I can live with, what I live with!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.58,0:36:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道我能做到什么  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna talk about what I can do, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说你自己怎样  我就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about what you can do? Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.86,0:36:47.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  兄弟  举起枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Raise your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:52.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我不会  -怎么了  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No, I will not.  - What happened, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.14,0:36:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你不再是个老好人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you weren't the good guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.57,0:36:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你自己说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that what you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.09,0:36:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使此时此地  你也不为他们而战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even right here, right now, you ain't gonna fight for 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.56,0:36:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比你更适合做父亲  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a better father than you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.13,0:37:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比你更适合与洛莉在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better for Lori than you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.53,0:37:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我比你更优秀  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause I'm a better man than you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我能站在这  为此战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I can be here and I'll fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.78,0:37:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的死而复生毁了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back here and you just destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.37,0:37:15.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子失去贞洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a broken woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.37,0:37:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儿子懦弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a weak boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么处理你毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't got the first clue on how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.64,0:37:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.71,0:37:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将杀死一个手无寸铁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to kill an unarmed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.28,0:37:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.03,0:37:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻松  简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.27,0:37:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很容易做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.41,0:38:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen to me, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还能挽回\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is still a way back from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.62,0:38:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当这事没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.83,0:38:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna lay down our guns
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.46,0:38:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走回农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna walk back to the farm...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.62,0:38:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.87,0:38:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到洛莉身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.61,0:38:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到卡尔身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.90,0:38:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这些忘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put this all behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.59,0:38:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你逼我这么做的  肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you for making me do this, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.57,0:39:00.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你  不是我  毁了你我的情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was you, not me! You did this to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.78,0:39:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的错  不是我  不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was you, not me... not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.56,0:39:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.14,0:40:40.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.02,0:40:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.58,0:41:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.68,0:41:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该回家和你妈在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be back home with mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.06,0:41:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放  放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... just put the...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.92,0:41:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.24,0:41:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是这样  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what it seems. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.36,0:42:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait wait wait wait.

